# PolyVinyl Support

Thank you for using PolyVinyl!
感谢您使用 PolyVinyl！

We are dedicated to providing the best immersive vinyl music experience. If you encounter any issues, have feature suggestions, or need assistance, please feel free to contact us.
我们致力于提供最沉浸的音乐体验。如果您在使用过程中遇到任何问题，或者有功能建议，请随时联系我们。

### Contact Us (联系方式)
📧 **Email**: feedback.polyvinyl@hotmail.com


### FAQ (常见问题)

**Q: Does it support Spotify? / 支持 Spotify 吗？**
A: Currently we only support Apple Music and Local Files (MP3, FLAC, etc.).
目前我们仅支持 Apple Music 和本地文件。

**Q: How to import local music? / 如何导入本地音乐？**
A: Go to the Library tab and tap the "+" icon to import audio files from your Files app.
前往“资料库”页面，点击“+”号图标即可从“文件”App 中导入音频。

**Q: Why is the album cover not showing? / 为什么封面不显示？**
A: Please check your network connection or ensure the song is matched correctly in your library. For local files, try re-importing them.
请检查您的网络连接，或确保歌曲在资料库中匹配正确。对于本地文件，请尝试重新导入。

**Q: Why is the metadata matching incorrect? / 为什么自动匹配的信息/封面不对？**
A: Our matching engine relies on file names. Please rename your audio files to include details like `Artist - Song - Album.mp3`.
我们的智能匹配引擎依赖文件名。建议您完善音频文件的命名，包含`歌手名 - 歌名 - 专辑名`，以提高匹配准确率。

**Q: Why are my uploaded lyrics not showing? / 为什么上传的歌词不显示？**
A: Please ensure the lyric file (.lrc) has the exact same filename as the audio file and is in the same folder.
请确保歌词文件（.lrc）与音频文件拥有完全一致的文件名，并且位于同一个文件夹内。
